#math namespace — every assertion is a self-check#

#Binary arithmetic#
assert![add![5 3] 8]
assert![sub![10 4] 6]
assert![mul![6 7] 42]
assert![div![20 4] 5]
assert![mod![10 3] 1]
assert![pow![2 8] 256]

#Variadic min / max — accept any number of Things#
assert![min![3 1 4 1 5 9 2 6] 1]
assert![max![3 1 4 1 5 9 2 6] 9]

#Type predicate#
assert![isnum!42 TRUE]
assert![isnum!hello FALSE]

#Pattern-shaped error message for wrong arity (demo, commented)#
#add!5#
